                                                "sense_id": "9a8d93a3-2ade-30e2-a69c-545073fdd621",
                                                "text": "2006, Peter Murray, David Poole, Grant Jones, Contemporary Issues in Management and Organisational Behaviour, Thomson, page 108,\nPlayers turned up for questioning wearing thongs, shorts and T-shirts."
                                            },
                                            {
